+After each turn, suggests up to three next prompts above the input box, in the terminal and in Claude Code Desktop.
+
+A local fork of [`next-steps`](https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-community/tree/main/next-steps) (upstream commit `87c843d52c12f4bc91bb23b47132eb08b70e6cb6`, version 1.0.0, MIT, by Thariq Shihipar). The suggestion logic is unchanged; only a Desktop renderer is added. It is renamed so it cannot clash with the upstream plugin.
 
